    {
      "id": "US-07.2",
      "title": "Decide the cross-border tariff for employees living in Germany",
      "as_a": "source_tax",
      "i_want": "employees living in Germany to state what they expect for the year: whether they return home daily, whether they have provided a certificate of residence, whether a daily return would be reasonable, and whether they expect more than 60 work-related non-return days",
      "so_that": "Lonio can decide, following the calculator, whether the cross-border tariff (A→L, B→M, C→N, H→P) or the normal tariff applies",
      "priority": "P1",
      "priority_reason": "Without these answers Lonio cannot compute the tariff code for German residents (D-001). HR finds these questions the hardest part of the calculator (F-hr_transcript-ab8886).",
      "acceptance_criteria": [
